CivicFlow
Administrative Requests Management System

Production URL:
https://civicflow.example.com

Admin Account:
admin@example.com

Backend API:
https://api.example.com

Technology:
React
Node.js
Express
PostgreSQL
Prisma

Main Features:
- Request Management
- Customer Management
- Ministries
- Cities
- Request Types
- SLA
- Notifications
- Public Tracking
- Public Request Submission
- Attachments
- Excel Export
- PDF Export
- Audit Logs
- RBAC